Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `values` was not moved here, so a stored lambda cannot write it
  --> tests/ui/closures/stored_lambda_cannot_write_a_lent_parameter.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     () -> values.push(1)
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `values` is lent for writing only until this call returns, and a stored lambda can run after that
 Fix: Make the parameter owned (`values: &&[Int]`) and return the result, or write `values` inside this call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
